    "innovation": "This paper quantifies uncertainty in Northern Hemisphere forest biomass from eight Earth system models, revealing that large biases originate from structural model differences in carbon allocation, vegetation distribution, and initial pre-industrial vegetation states, which are a larger source of uncertainty than transient climate responses.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
